        "source_solution": "Full 823 a-h: sqrt45,-sqrt50,sqrt28,-sqrt108,sqrt(5a),-sqrt(72c),sqrt(3x/2),-sqrt(4y/3). The seed's last four radicands require a,c,x,y>=0. Their coefficient squares are 25,144,1/4,4/9.",
